		<title>Energy Company Fights Back with MVISION EDR as Covid-19 Increases Threat Campaigns</title>
		<link>https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/enterprise/endpoint-security/energy-company-fights-back-with-mvision-edr-as-covid-19-increases-threat-campaigns/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[McAfee]]></dc:creator>
