</td>
<td style="width: 112.25%;">
<h3>Expansions to McAfee’s MVISION Platform</h3>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Continuing on MPOWER’s momentum, we <a href="https://www.mcafee.com/enterprise/en-us/about/newsroom/press-releases/press-release.html?news_id=5ef09bb3-bffe-4a2d-9499-8c15a1a55934" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">launched MVISION Marketplace, MVISION API and MVISION Developer Portal</a>, allowing customers to quickly and easily integrate McAfee and trusted SIA partner applications as well as privately developed applications within their current security environment. The launch enables security teams to swiftly address security gaps in their architecture and easily improve security posture.</p>
