</tbody>
</table>
<p>On October 22, 2020, McAfee <a href="https://www.mcafee.com/enterprise/en-us/about/newsroom/press-releases/press-release.html?news_id=c213eba0-cec0-483d-a83b-6376456c56f3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">rang the bell on NASDAQ</a> and officially became a publicly traded company again. It was a momentous occasion for the company and all our dedicated employees and partners. A huge thank you goes out to our employees for their support and invaluable contributions in helping McAfee reach this milestone We’re excited for the future!</p>
<p>Thank you to our wonderful employees, partners and customers for helping us achieve our goals and we look forward to working with everyone in the new year!</p>
