		<title>Home-Point Cybersecurity: Bring Your Enterprise Home</title>
		<link>https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/executive-perspectives/home-point-cybersecurity-bring-your-enterprise-home/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Kent Landfield]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2020 16:00:45 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Executive Perspectives]]></category>
