<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;"><strong>Search Career Opportunities with McAfee</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Interested in joining our team? We’re hiring!<strong> </strong><a href="https://careers.mcafee.com/?utm_source=lm-blog&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=20q4-apply-now"><strong>Apply now</strong>.</a></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 14pt;"><strong>Stay Connected</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">For more stories like this, follow <strong><a href="https://www.instagram.com/lifeatmcafee/">@LifeAtMcAfee</a></strong> on Instagram and on Twitter <strong><a href="https://twitter.com/McAfee">@McAfee </a></strong>to see what working at McAfee is all about.</span></td>
