<p>McAfee also received <a href="https://www.mcafee.com/enterprise/en-us/about/newsroom/press-releases/press-release.html?news_id=067f564a-2935-440e-b8e0-d695c37ca0a3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">recognition</a> as the only vendor to be named the <a href="https://www.gartner.com/reviews/market/cloud-access-security-brokers" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">January 2020 Gartner Peer Insights Customers’ Choice for Cloud Access Security Brokers</a> based on customer feedback and ratings for McAfee MVISION Cloud.</p>
