		<title>FedRAMP – What’s the Big Deal?</title>
		<link>https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/executive-perspectives/fedramp-whats-the-big-deal/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Tom Gann]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2020 15:00:05 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Executive Perspectives]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[public sector]]></category>
