					<description><![CDATA[<div><img width="300" height="300" src="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/MFE_VotingBadge-1-300x300-1.png" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="Protect Your Vote" style="margin-bottom: 15px;" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/MFE_VotingBadge-1-300x300-1.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/MFE_VotingBadge-1-300x300-1-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/MFE_VotingBadge-1-300x300-1-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/MFE_VotingBadge-1-300x300-1-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/MFE_VotingBadge-1-300x300-1-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/MFE_VotingBadge-1-300x300-1-96x96.png 96w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div>
