<p>Senior Consultant, Services Industry. <a href="https://www.gartner.com/reviews/market/security-information-event-management/vendor/mcafee/product/mcafee-enterprise-security-manager/review/view/1314283" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read full review here.</a></p>
<p>To all our customers who submitted reviews, thank you! These reviews mold our products and our customer journey, and we look forward to building on the experience that earned us this distinction!</p>
