										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div><img width="300" height="158" src="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS_Part5-300x158.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="" style="margin-bottom: 15px;" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS_Part5-300x158.jpg 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS_Part5-1024x538.jpg 1024w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS_Part5-768x403.jpg 768w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS_Part5-205x108.jpg 205w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS_Part5.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div><p><span data-contrast="auto">W</span><span data-contrast="auto">omen at McAfee are making powerful contributions to </span><span data-contrast="auto">our</span><span data-contrast="auto"> sales efforts. </span><span data-contrast="auto">Saleswomen</span><span data-contrast="auto"> from varying backgrounds share their unique perspectives </span><span data-contrast="auto">in hopes of encouraging more women to join them in sales. </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">This week</span><span data-contrast="auto">, </span><span data-contrast="auto">women share the inspirations and support networks which are leading them down successful sales paths.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">And i</span><span data-contrast="auto">n case you missed it, </span><span data-contrast="auto">meet more women at</span><span data-contrast="auto"> McAfee </span><span data-contrast="auto">who </span><a href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/life-at-mcafee/women-in-sales-part-1-opportunities-for-women-across-cybersecurity-sales/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span data-contrast="none">discussed opportunities in the field</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">, </span><a href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/life-at-mcafee/women-in-sales-part-2-skilling-up-for-a-career-in-cybersecurity-sales/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span data-contrast="none">offered insight into the necessary skills to succeed</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">, </span><a href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/life-at-mcafee/women-in-sales-part-3-traits-for-success-in-cybersecurity-sales/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span data-contrast="none">shared the distinguishing traits that defined their success</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">, and </span><a href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/life-at-mcafee/women-in-sales-part-4-achieving-success-through-growth-and-balance/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span data-contrast="none">illustrated the importance of learning and maintaining balance</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">.</span></p>
<p><img class="alignright wp-image-105372 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Aleks-Purcell-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Aleks-Purcell-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Aleks-Purcell-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Aleks-Purcell-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Aleks-Purcell-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Aleks-Purcell-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Aleks-Purcell-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Aleks-Purcell.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
<b><span data-contrast="none">Find a sponsor:</span></b><span data-contrast="none"> </span><span data-contrast="none">“</span><span data-contrast="none">First, f</span><span data-contrast="none">ind someone working in sales or presales who can serve as your sponsor</span><span data-contrast="none">. This is</span><span data-contrast="none"> someone </span><span data-contrast="none">who</span><span data-contrast="none"> </span><span data-contrast="none">can</span><span data-contrast="none"> get</span><span data-contrast="none"> you</span><span data-contrast="none"> in touch with the right people. </span><span data-contrast="none">Then</span><span data-contrast="none">, show your value, communicate clearly, and own your brand. Make yourself visible and connect with people who can promote you inside of sales. Start with a professional LinkedIn account. </span><span data-contrast="none">Work hard, and m</span><span data-contrast="none">ost importantly, </span><span data-contrast="none">tell</span><span data-contrast="none"> your manager and peers about</span><span data-contrast="none"> your</span><span data-contrast="none"> </span><span data-contrast="none">goals.</span><span data-contrast="none"> If you don’t communicate your interest </span><span data-contrast="none">in</span><span data-contrast="none"> advancing or </span><span data-contrast="none">moving to different roles</span><span data-contrast="none">, they won’t be aware </span><span data-contrast="none">and can’t help you get there</span><span data-contrast="none">.</span><span data-contrast="none">”</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none">– Aleks, Inside Sales, Cork</span><span data-contrast="none">, Ireland</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2 SCXW104678743 BCX0"><img class="alignright wp-image-105380 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-1-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-1-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-1-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-1-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-1-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-1-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-1-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-1.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></span></p>
<p><strong>Find inspiration through family: </strong>“<span class="TextRun SCXW78908902 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW78908902 BCX0">The biggest inspirations for me are my mom and my grandma. Back in the day, my grandma broke glass ceilings with double university degrees and built a career in Soviet Russia when it was uncommon. My mom passed me all her knowledge and her entrepreneur spirit. She has always been very strict and demanding, but she taught me how to be brave and independent. She continues to teach me to this day how to question my own thoughts and habits as well as encourage me to think outside-of-the-box.”</span></span></p>
<p><span class="TextRun SCXW51726846 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW51726846 BCX0">– Anastasia, Inside Sales, Cork, Ireland</span></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img class="alignright wp-image-105382 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Brenda-Moretto-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Brenda-Moretto-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Brenda-Moretto-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Brenda-Moretto-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Brenda-Moretto-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Brenda-Moretto-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Brenda-Moretto-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Brenda-Moretto.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Strive to grow and improve.</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> “Early in my career, I worked for an amazing manager. She told me it was up to me to decide what I wanted to be. She also said there was no one right choice if I stayed as an individual contributor or grew to be a senior leader – because whatever I decided, I should be incredibly ambitious and always strive to make myself better. I encourage you to ask a successful woman in tech, ‘How did you get there and what skills are needed to succeed in your role?’ Ask questions, find a mentor and create a plan for how you can enter that space.” </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">– Brenda, Consumer Sales, Vancouver</span><span data-contrast="auto">, Canada</span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="alignright wp-image-105384 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Carine-Fazzani-1-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Carine-Fazzani-1-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Carine-Fazzani-1-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Carine-Fazzani-1-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Carine-Fazzani-1-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Carine-Fazzani-1-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Carine-Fazzani-1-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Carine-Fazzani-1.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></span></b></p>
<p><strong>Look to the women around you: </strong><span data-contrast="auto">“The women in my family inspire me the most. They are no</span><span data-contrast="auto">t afraid to take on big challenges that move them forward – whether as a stay-at-home mom, professional in the corporate world, or an entrepreneur. They’ve overcome a lot of challenges. My mother started her own business at the age of 62. She was a stay-at-home mom when my siblings and I were still at home. It is the small things that women do that inspire me all the time!”</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">– Carine,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> Presales/</span><span data-contrast="auto">Sales Engineering, Plano, TX</span><span data-contrast="auto">, United States</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><br />
<img class="alignright wp-image-105386 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-1-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-1-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-1-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-1-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-1-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-1-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-1-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-1.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
Partnership goes a long way: </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">“Networking</span><span data-contrast="auto"> can</span><span data-contrast="auto"> create</span><span data-contrast="auto"> big</span><span data-contrast="auto"> opportunities. I built a relationship with one of the sales engineers while working in a support role. He came to me for help when h</span><span data-contrast="auto">e worked with </span><span data-contrast="auto">customers and </span><span data-contrast="auto">partnered together</span><span data-contrast="auto">. I stayed in touch and reached out to him when deciding to pursue a career in sales. I asked for the chance to interview for a sales engineer position and ultimately got the job.”</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">– Elizabeth, </span><span data-contrast="auto">Presales/</span><span data-contrast="auto">Sales Engineering, Plano,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">TX</span><span data-contrast="auto">, United States</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><br />
<img class="alignright wp-image-105388 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-3-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-3-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-3-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-3-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-3-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-3-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-3-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-3.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
