Find</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">inspiration all around:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">“​I</span><span data-contrast="auto">’m</span><span data-contrast="auto"> inspired reading about what other ladies like me accomplish daily. I see them juggling so many balls and still be</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">successful, yet they are vulnerable</span><span data-contrast="auto">.</span><span data-contrast="auto"> Many of them advocate</span><span data-contrast="auto"> publicly and privately for the advancement and equality for all women.</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">Ruth Bader Ginsburg is a pioneer and Rosa Parks just decided to say no. They are just two of many, many others who have shaped our world. They are inspiration for many, but we inspire ourselves more than we realize </span><span data-contrast="auto">b</span><span data-contrast="auto">y the things we do every single day. This inspiration has helped me achieve success in the technological world of cybersecurity sales at McAfee.</span><span data-contrast="auto">”</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
