		<title>The Economic Benefits from McAfee’s UCE Solution</title>
		<link>https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/enterprise/the-economic-benefits-from-mcafees-uce-solution/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Pooja Kapoor]]></dc:creator>
