ontrast="auto"> who’ve paused careers</span><span data-contrast="auto"> can </span><span data-contrast="auto">rejoin</span><span data-contrast="auto"> the industry. </span><span data-contrast="auto">It helps to l</span><span data-contrast="auto">everage the </span><span data-contrast="auto">many online resources available </span><span data-contrast="auto">so you</span><span data-contrast="auto"> can</span><span data-contrast="auto"> keep learning about the industry </span><span data-contrast="auto">and </span><span data-contrast="auto">pick up different skills to equip yourself with relevant knowledge.</span><span data-contrast="auto">”</span></p>
