><span data-contrast="auto">teaches us so that we grow</span><span data-contrast="auto"> – and</span><span data-contrast="auto"> success comes with growth. </span><span data-contrast="auto">S</span><span data-contrast="auto">oak up the experience of your peers, leaders</span><span data-contrast="auto">,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> and mentors, and </span><span data-contrast="auto">carry the mindset that you will never</span><span data-contrast="auto"> stop learning. The payoff is worth it.</span><span data-contrast="auto">”</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
