an><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">balance</span><span data-contrast="auto"> is just part of the greater learning process. </span><span data-contrast="auto">Now, e</span><span data-contrast="auto">ach week I look at my schedule and find ‘me’ time. I also try to keep my office and home life separate, especially in the physical space.”</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
