										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div><img width="300" height="158" src="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS-LinkedIn-part3-FINAL-300x158.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="" style="margin-bottom: 15px;" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS-LinkedIn-part3-FINAL-300x158.jpg 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS-LinkedIn-part3-FINAL-1024x538.jpg 1024w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS-LinkedIn-part3-FINAL-768x403.jpg 768w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS-LinkedIn-part3-FINAL-205x108.jpg 205w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/WIS-LinkedIn-part3-FINAL.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div><p><span data-contrast="auto">At McAfee, women are finding the inclusi</span><span data-contrast="auto">veness and tools to </span><span data-contrast="auto">succeed</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">in cybersecurity sales, a field </span><span data-contrast="auto">often </span><span data-contrast="auto">misconceived </span><span data-contrast="auto">because of its technical background</span><span data-contrast="auto">.</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">They are doing so </span><span data-contrast="auto">through perseverance, resolve</span><span data-contrast="auto">,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> and</span><span data-contrast="auto"> the</span><span data-contrast="auto"> know-how</span><span data-contrast="auto"> to excel as sales professionals</span><span data-contrast="auto">.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">We recently kicked off </span><span data-contrast="auto">our </span><span data-contrast="auto">Women in Sales </span><span data-contrast="auto">Series</span><span data-contrast="auto">, which </span><span data-contrast="auto">features inspiring </span><span data-contrast="auto">wome</span><span data-contrast="auto">n</span><span data-contrast="auto"> at McAfee</span><span data-contrast="auto">. </span><a href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/life-at-mcafee/women-in-sales-part-1-opportunities-for-women-across-cybersecurity-sales/"><span data-contrast="none">In </span><span data-contrast="none">Part 1</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">, leading</span><span data-contrast="auto"> women</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">discussed</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">opportunities </span><span data-contrast="auto">a</span><span data-contrast="auto">nd </span><a href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/life-at-mcafee/women-in-sales-part-2-skilling-up-for-a-career-in-cybersecurity-sales/"><span data-contrast="none">in </span><span data-contrast="none">Part 2</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">, they outlined </span><span data-contrast="auto">the necessary </span><span data-contrast="auto">skills to succeed.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">This week</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">meet </span><span data-contrast="auto">more </span><span data-contrast="auto">women at McAfee </span><span data-contrast="auto">as they </span><span data-contrast="auto">share their advice and </span><span data-contrast="auto">distinguishing quali</span><span data-contrast="auto">ties </span><span data-contrast="auto">or characteristics </span><span data-contrast="auto">that defined their success </span><span data-contrast="auto">as</span><span data-contrast="auto"> cybersecurity sales </span><span data-contrast="auto">professionals</span><span data-contrast="auto">.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="wp-image-104782 size-thumbnail alignright" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Amy-Sumner-1-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Amy-Sumner-1-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Amy-Sumner-1-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Amy-Sumner-1-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Amy-Sumner-1-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Amy-Sumner-1-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Amy-Sumner-1-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Amy-Sumner-1.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
Self-belief</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">: </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">“</span><span data-contrast="auto">B</span><span data-contrast="auto">e strong</span><span data-contrast="auto">,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> and not disqualify </span><span data-contrast="auto">yourself</span><span data-contrast="auto"> if </span><span data-contrast="auto">you </span><span data-contrast="auto">aren’t the expert in the room. Remember, nobody has all the answers.</span><span data-contrast="auto"> Don’t be afraid to ask questions — it demonstrates your willingness to learn. </span><span data-contrast="auto">Believe in yourself.”</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">— </span><span data-contrast="auto">Amy, Enterprise Sales, Charlotte</span><span data-contrast="auto">,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">NC, United States</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span><b></b></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img class="alignright wp-image-104785 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Anastasia-Alen.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><strong>Resiliency</strong><b><span data-contrast="auto"><strong> </strong>and </span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">p</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">ractice</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">“Be brave, and in the face of adversity</span><span data-contrast="auto">,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> just keep ‘swimming.’ You won’t ever become good at anything if you do not try, and </span><span data-contrast="auto">like </span><span data-contrast="auto">in most things</span><span data-contrast="auto">,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> you only become good </span><span data-contrast="auto">at sale</span><span data-contrast="auto">s </span><span data-contrast="auto">with practice. Don’t be afraid to network</span><span data-contrast="auto">; i</span><span data-contrast="auto">t’s essential to</span><span data-contrast="auto"> build</span><span data-contrast="auto">ing</span><span data-contrast="auto"> connections outside </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">the workplace</span><span data-contrast="auto">. Be open to </span><span data-contrast="auto">learning </span><span data-contrast="auto">either through a mentor or as a volunteer in the industry</span><span data-contrast="auto">; it will help you </span><span data-contrast="auto">overcome any obstacles</span><span data-contrast="auto">.” </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">—</span><span data-contrast="auto"> Anastasia, Inside Sales, Cork</span><span data-contrast="auto">,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> I</span><span data-contrast="auto">reland</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><br />
<img class="wp-image-104788 size-thumbnail alignright" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Gauri-Palekar-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Gauri-Palekar-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Gauri-Palekar-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Gauri-Palekar-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Gauri-Palekar-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Gauri-Palekar-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Gauri-Palekar-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Gauri-Palekar.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" />Curiosity:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">“Be confident, be prepared,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> and</span><span data-contrast="auto"> be a good listener</span><span data-contrast="auto">, but most importantly, be curious </span><span data-contrast="auto">and willing to improve. </span><span data-contrast="auto">When </span><span data-contrast="auto">your instinct </span><span data-contrast="auto">tells </span><span data-contrast="auto">you can</span><span data-contrast="auto"> do it</span><span data-contrast="auto">, do it</span><span data-contrast="auto"> or learn how to do it</span><span data-contrast="auto">. </span><span data-contrast="auto">I</span><span data-contrast="auto">f you don’t understand, ask until you do </span><span data-contrast="auto">—</span><span data-contrast="auto"> the willingness to learn and be honest with yourself will take you a long way. </span><span data-contrast="auto">Looking inward will help you </span><span data-contrast="auto">work towards self-development</span><span data-contrast="auto">. Own your success and l</span><span data-contrast="auto">isten</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">to your customers and colleagues</span><span data-contrast="auto">; they </span><span data-contrast="auto">offer so much knowledg</span><span data-contrast="auto">e</span><span data-contrast="auto">. </span><span data-contrast="auto">I’ve been lucky to know sponsors who have guided me and signed up for McAfee’s mentor program. T</span><span data-contrast="auto">he value of sponsors and mentors cannot be defined. </span><span data-contrast="auto">N</span><span data-contrast="auto">ever stop at learning</span><span data-contrast="auto">.”</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">—</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">Guari</span><span data-contrast="auto">,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> Inside Sales,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> Mumbai, I</span><span data-contrast="auto">ndia</span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="alignright wp-image-104791 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Jardin-Battle-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Jardin-Battle-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Jardin-Battle-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Jardin-Battle-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Jardin-Battle-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Jardin-Battle-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Jardin-Battle-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Jardin-Battle.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></span></b></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Ambition</strong><b><span data-contrast="auto">:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">“Put yourself out there. Do not become complacent and settle for something below your expectations or the intended result. Make sure your personal brand is solid and leverage that to make connections and network.”</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">—</span><span data-contrast="auto"> Jardin, Inside Sales, Plano</span><span data-contrast="auto">,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> T</span><span data-contrast="auto">X, United States</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><br />
<img class="alignright wp-image-104794 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-1-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-1-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-1-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-1-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-1-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-1-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-1-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Kate-Friesing-1.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
Persistence:</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">“When you get your foot in the door</span><span data-contrast="auto"> for an interview,</span><span data-contrast="auto"> be persistent. You should be strong and ask tough questions</span><span data-contrast="auto"> that may move you o</span><span data-contrast="auto">ut of your comfort zone. I try to close the interviewer and learn from the conversation by asking what concerns they had about my candidacy. Use that opportunity to see where you might improve or strengthen your interview skills. Doing so shows the prospective employer </span><span data-contrast="auto">the</span><span data-contrast="auto"> type of salesperson you can be.” </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">—</span><span data-contrast="auto"> Kate, </span><span data-contrast="auto">Enterprise Sales – F</span><span data-contrast="auto">ederal</span><span data-contrast="auto">, Washington, D.C.</span><span data-contrast="auto">, United States</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="alignright wp-image-104797 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Krista-Kramer-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Krista-Kramer-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Krista-Kramer-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Krista-Kramer-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Krista-Kramer-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Krista-Kramer-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Krista-Kramer-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Krista-Kramer.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
