<p><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-103698" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/53.png" alt="" width="975" height="73" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/53.png 975w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/53-300x22.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/53-768x58.png 768w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/53-205x15.png 205w" sizes="(max-width: 975px) 100vw, 975px" /></p>
