					<description><![CDATA[<div><img width="300" height="200" src="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/McAfee_consumer_1female1child_smartphone_cafe_72dpi-300x200.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="Child using smartphone" style="margin-bottom: 15px;" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/McAfee_consumer_1female1child_smartphone_cafe_72dpi-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/McAfee_consumer_1female1child_smartphone_cafe_72dpi-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/McAfee_consumer_1female1child_smartphone_cafe_72dpi-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/McAfee_consumer_1female1child_smartphone_cafe_72dpi-749x500.jpg 749w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/McAfee_consumer_1female1child_smartphone_cafe_72dpi.jpg 1382w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div>
