<p><a href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/life-at-mcafee/women-in-sales-part-1-opportunities-for-women-across-cybersecurity-sales/"><span data-contrast="none">In Part 1</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">, </span><span data-contrast="auto">McAfee women described industry </span><span data-contrast="auto">opportunities </span><span data-contrast="auto">and how they </span><span data-contrast="auto">continue to break boundaries</span><span data-contrast="auto"> to develop rewarding careers.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Here in Part 2, </span><span data-contrast="auto">we introduce women whose </span><span data-contrast="auto">unique </span><span data-contrast="auto">past experiences helped shape their </span><span data-contrast="auto">career paths. They</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">share</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">critical </span><span data-contrast="auto">skills</span><span data-contrast="auto"> for success</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">and </span><span data-contrast="auto">words of </span><span data-contrast="auto">encouragement</span><span data-contrast="auto"> for those </span><span data-contrast="auto">considering</span><span data-contrast="auto"> a career in sales</span><span data-contrast="auto">.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="alignright wp-image-104253" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Amy-Sumner-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Amy-Sumner-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Amy-Sumner-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Amy-Sumner-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Amy-Sumner-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Amy-Sumner-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Amy-Sumner-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Amy-Sumner.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></span></b></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><br />
Practice clear c</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">ommunicat</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">ion and collaboration</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">:</span></b><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">“In a sales role, you constant</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ly</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> communicat</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">e</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> with customers to </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">help them achieve their desired outcomes with</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> evolving solutions. We need people who can maintain relationships while demonstrating their relevance to stakeholders, C-level </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">and highly</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> technical engineer roles. My more successful peers are those who can navigate through various layers of organizational complexity</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> because they know i</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">t takes dedication and expertise from everyone on the team to close deals. Keeping team members informed and constantly collaborating is critical throughout every step of the sales process.”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">—</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Amy, Enterprise Sales, Charlotte, N</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">orth Carolina</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="alignright wp-image-104256 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Carine-Fazzani-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Carine-Fazzani-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Carine-Fazzani-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Carine-Fazzani-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Carine-Fazzani-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Carine-Fazzani-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Carine-Fazzani-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Carine-Fazzani.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></span></b></p>
<p><strong>Be confident and take the leap:</strong><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">“</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">My experience started in IT after I graduated from college</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">. L</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ater</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">,</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> I joined technical support at McAfee</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> and</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> was asked if I was interested in a sales engineering role. I didn’t have the experience but was excited to try something new and </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">made the decision to leap</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> into a sales career. </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">My</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> experience in technical support helped me get up to speed in sales engineering, and I love it.”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">— Carine, </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Presales/</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Sales Engineer</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ing</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">, Plano, T</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">exas</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="alignright wp-image-104259 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Elizabeth-Knollenberg-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Elizabeth-Knollenberg.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
Build relationships and know the business: </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">“</span><i><span data-contrast="auto">If you’re focused and determined, you </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">can succeed in sales. The most challenging part for me was picking up the sales piece as</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> I</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> already had a technical background. If you want to get into presales, </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">half is relating to</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> people</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> and</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> build</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ing</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">strong </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">relationships with the customer. The other half is engineering, and here</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">,</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> you need to </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">learn</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> enough of everything to h</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">old</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> knowledgeabl</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">e</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> conversations. </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">I</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">nvestigat</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ing</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> resources quickly to </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">source</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> answers for the customer is also important. Be confident in yourself and your abilities.”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">— Elizabeth,</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> Presales/</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Sales Engineer</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ing</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">, Plano, T</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">exas</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="alignright wp-image-104262 size-thumbnail" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Kate-Friesing-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Kate-Friesing-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Kate-Friesing-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Kate-Friesing-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Kate-Friesing-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Kate-Friesing-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Kate-Friesing-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Kate-Friesing.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></span></b></p>
<p><strong>Find your passion, then network:</strong> <i><span data-contrast="auto">“I</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">’ve</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> found a degree in psychology handy in a sales career. It is easier for me to engage with people, read a situatio</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">n</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> and build rapport. </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">With</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> some experience, I s</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">aw</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> a future in sales and carve</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">d</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> out my career path. I thought the life of a field sales rep was exciting</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><span data-contrast="auto">—</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">greater earnings, more flexibility and so on. Once I knew </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">I had found</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> my path, I looked for opportunities to network with sales executives, get exposure and learn from them. Networking enabled me to build a name for myself and a personal brand.”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">— Kate, </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Enterprise Sales – </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Federal, Washington, DC</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="wp-image-104265 size-thumbnail alignright" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Melissa-Killebrew-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Melissa-Killebrew-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Melissa-Killebrew-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Melissa-Killebrew-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Melissa-Killebrew-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Melissa-Killebrew-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Melissa-Killebrew-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Melissa-Killebrew.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></span></b></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Leverage your transferable skills:<i> </i></strong><i><span data-contrast="auto">“I</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> previously</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> work</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ed</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> in real estate designing high rise office buildings</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">.</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> I eventually wanted to try a different field. My presentation and project management skills were transferable, so I changed industries to telecom and began as a technical trainer. I eventually moved into a </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">s</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ales </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">e</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ngineering role here at McAfee and </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">am </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">currently</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> in</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> a </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">s</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ales </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">a</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">rchitect role.”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">— Melissa, </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Presales/</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Sales Engineering, Plano, T</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">exas</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="wp-image-104268 size-thumbnail alignright" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Marta-Bandolin-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Marta-Bandolin-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Marta-Bandolin-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Marta-Bandolin-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Marta-Bandolin-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Marta-Bandolin-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Marta-Bandolin-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Marta-Bandolin.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></span></b></p>
<p><strong>Understand the customer’s needs</strong>:<i><span data-contrast="auto"> “</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Sales is about </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">cultivating </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">relationships, understanding the customers’ needs and finding the best solution for them. These are the essential skills when considering a career in sales. You</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">’ll</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> never know if you can be successful if you don’t attempt it.</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">— Marta, Inside</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> Sales, </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Cork, Ireland</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><br />
<img class="wp-image-104271 size-thumbnail alignright" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Paige-Kha-1-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Paige-Kha-1-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Paige-Kha-1-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Paige-Kha-1-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Paige-Kha-1-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Paige-Kha-1-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Paige-Kha-1-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Paige-Kha-1.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
Build a social platform and know when to speak up</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">:</span></b><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">“Look at your collective skillset and see how you can leverage it for sales. Be sure to showcase it on your resume and social channels like LinkedIn. Then network, network, network. Have a few good mentors in your corner who can make some connections for you internally and externally. </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">But remember, are responsible for your career</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><span data-contrast="auto">—</span><i><span data-contrast="auto"> you must speak up and make sure your career goals and desired career path are known by leadership.”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">— Paige, Sales Operations</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">, Plano, T</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">exas</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><img class="wp-image-104274 size-thumbnail alignright" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Preet-Grewal-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Preet-Grewal-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Preet-Grewal-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Preet-Grewal-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Preet-Grewal-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Preet-Grewal-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Preet-Grewal-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Preet-Grewal.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
Spend time on people</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">:</span></b><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">“When I first began my career in sales operations, it helped me immensely to try and understand other’s points of view. You cannot find success in a vacuum and people are complex. My advice is to take time to understand people. Then, with dedication and hard work, the value you add will show through.”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">— Preet, Sales</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> Operations</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">, Plano, T</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">exas</span></i></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><br />
<img class="wp-image-104277 size-thumbnail alignright" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sandra-Wang-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sandra-Wang-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sandra-Wang-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sandra-Wang-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sandra-Wang-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sandra-Wang-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sandra-Wang-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sandra-Wang.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /><br />
Speak the language</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">:</span></b><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">“Presales is a bridge that links</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> the</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> tech</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">nical</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">to the </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">sale, which means you need to understand two languages: technical and </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">business</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">. It is challenging</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">,</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> but also very exciting. For those looking to </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">enter</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> the industry, I recommend you leverage social media and connect with people to tap into their wisdom. This is how I found my current </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">position</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">.</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">— Sandra, </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Presales/</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Sales Engineer</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">ing</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">, Sydney</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">,</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> Australia</span></i></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto"><br />
<img class="wp-image-104280 size-thumbnail alignright" src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sophie-Lambert-150x150.png" alt="" width="150" height="150" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sophie-Lambert-150x150.png 150w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sophie-Lambert-300x300.png 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sophie-Lambert-129x129.png 129w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sophie-Lambert-24x24.png 24w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sophie-Lambert-48x48.png 48w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sophie-Lambert-96x96.png 96w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Sophie-Lambert.png 500w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></span></b></p>
<p><strong>Understand your team and </strong><b><span data-contrast="auto"><strong>global</strong> </span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto">partners:</span></b><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">“Go for it! The sales industry is unlike any other. A sales role offers </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">an</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">opportunity </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">for anyone with a </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">willingness to put in the work. In my position, there are </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">two</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> key </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">indicators </span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">for success </span></i><span data-contrast="auto">—</span><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">understanding </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">what motivates </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">my team</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> and navigating </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">the nuances </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">of interacting with diverse, global </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">partners</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">.</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">— </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Sophie,</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Sales Project Management</span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">, Cork, Ireland</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><br />
It takes not only the range of talent these women bring to the table, but also passion, motivation and courage to thrive. </span><span data-contrast="auto">Next we</span><span data-contrast="auto">ek, meet</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">more </span><span data-contrast="auto">McAfee </span><span data-contrast="auto">women in sales</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">who</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">will provide their perspectives on</span><span data-contrast="auto"> traits</span><span data-contrast="auto"> needed for</span><span data-contrast="auto"> a successful career in cybersecurity sales.</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">Interested in joining a company that supports inclusion and belonging? </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto"><a href="https://careers.mcafee.com/?utm_source=lm-blog&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=womeninsales" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Search our jobs</a></span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">. </span></i><i><span data-contrast="auto">Subscribe to <a href="https://careers.mcafee.com/search-jobs#job-alerts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">job alerts</a>.</span></i></p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/life-at-mcafee/women-in-sales-part-2-skilling-up-for-a-career-in-cybersecurity-sales/">Women in Sales Part 2: Skilling up for a Career in Cybersecurity Sales</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs">McAfee Blogs</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
