					<description><![CDATA[<div><img width="300" height="176" src="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/FINAL-NID-Blog-Image-300x176.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="" style="margin-bottom: 15px;" srcset="https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/FINAL-NID-Blog-Image-300x176.jpg 300w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/FINAL-NID-Blog-Image-768x451.jpg 768w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/FINAL-NID-Blog-Image-205x120.jpg 205w, https://www.mcafee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/FINAL-NID-Blog-Image.jpg 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div>
<p>At McAfee, we foster meaningful internship experiences within our fast-paced world of cybersecurity.  We know it’s the next generation that will build tomorrow’s technology solutions. McAfee interns make substantial contributions and are valued as global team members, joining our mission to protect all that matters.  This year, McAfee took the intern experience virtual due to the global pandemic. While not our typical experience, this year’s interns continue to thrive. To celebrate National Intern Day, we asked our interns around the world to share insights gained from their experiences. “My new colleagues and leaders have helped me transition from college life to my full-time internship at [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs/other-blogs/life-at-mcafee/what-is-a-mcafee-internship-like-10-interns-share-perspectives/">What is a McAfee Internship Like? 10 Interns Share Perspectives</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="https://www.mcafee.com/blogs">McAfee Blogs</a>.</p>
