<li>To enter, go to <a href="https://twitter.com/McAfee_Home">https://twitter.com/McAfee_Home</a>, and find the #RT2Win sweepstakes tweet.</li>
<li>There will be four [4] sweepstakes tweets will be released at the following schedule including the hashtags: <strong>#RT2Win</strong> #<strong>Sweepstakes</strong> AND <strong>#SecureMyLife</strong>
<ul>
<li>Monday, August 3, 2020 at 9:05AM PST</li>
<li>Thursday, August 6, 2020 at 9:05AM PST</li>
<li>Monday, August 10, 2020 at 9:05AM PST</li>
<li>Thursday, August 13, 2020 at 9:05AM PST</li>
