<p><strong>     2. How to Enter: </strong></p>
<p>No purchase necessary. A purchase will not increase your chances of winning. McAfee’s #RT2Win  Sweepstakes will be conducted from August 3rd through August 16th. All entries for each day of the #SecureMyLife  RT2Win Sweepstakes must be received during the time allotted for the #RT2Win   Sweepstakes. Pacific Daylight Time shall control the McAfee RT2Win Sweepstakes. The #SecureMyLife RT2Win Sweepstakes duration is as follows:</p>
<p>#RT2Win   Sweepstakes:</p>
