<p>Note: the documents in the table with “No DocID” were the “dotm” files containing the macros/payload.</p>
<p>All files were created with Word 2016 and had both the English and Korean languages installed. This analysis into the metadata indicates that there is a high confidence that the malicious documents were created from a common root document.</p>
