<tbody>
<tr>
<td width="623">C:\Windows\System32\rundll32.exe &#8220;C:\Users\user\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Notice\wsdts.db&#8221;, sqlite3_steps S-6-81-3811-75432205-060098-6872 0 0 61 1</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>The required parameters to launch the malicious implant are:</p>
